ode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "format": "dash-1551732443255594v - 1080x1920 (DASH video)"}], "title": "Video by tomcflower", "description": "I used to think switching off meant falling behind or losing everything I’d worked so hard to build.\n\nTwo weeks driving across the bottom of Australia taught me the opposite.\n\nLife offline is what fuels everything that happens online.\n\nYou don’t need to delete social media.\nYou don’t need to post every day.\n\nBlock out your weekends.\nGo outside.\nCome back with something worth saying.\n\nYour story is what makes you worth listening to.", "duration": 78.669, "timestamp": 1778832000, "uploader_id": "33261547772", "uploader": "Tom Flower | Story & Brand Building", "channel": "tomcflower", "like_count": 234, "comment_count": 7, "comments": [{"author": "laura.josefina.mitre", "author_id": "18653679562", "id": "18098465359872707", "text": "🙌", "timestamp": 1778967840}, {"author": "visualsbyhouss", "author_id": "78789249078", "id": "18114885001838178", "text": "Mann this is exactly what I was looking for, I am starting for the outdoors, always had a passion for it.", "timestamp": 1778958779}, {"author": "nathandoncon", "author_id": "326937776", "id": "18123488515623188", "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "timestamp": 1778845278}, {"author": "oliviamkemp", "author_id": "430556638", "id": "17955340133964554", "text": "At least you didn’t disappear from me (tbh i wouldn’t let you) x", "timestamp": 1778839603}, {"author": "_lifeofsol", "author_id": "71575016441", "id": "18097368626171545", "text": "The best things come from switching off 🌞", "timestamp": 1778839569}, {"author": "endlessparks", "author_id": "64826575729", "id": "18145026694504489", "text": "Awesome stuff man! \n\nThe outdoors has a magical way of resetting us to what really matter!", "timestamp": 1778838244}, {"author": "unqualifiedbutfunded", "author_id": "259644077", "id": "17863766163686505", "text": "Do it again.", "timestamp": 1778834428}], "thumbn